 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025, the county&rsquo;s middle value ran 154% of normal in April to May and 62% of normal in August to September. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1987, as low as 61% of normal on grids 22990 and 23290. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 43% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value.</p>"}
